<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4700 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4700 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4700 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.4500 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 18		 June 17</p>
<p> High			     75.4700		 75.5450</p>
<p> Low				75.3500		 75.4200</p>
<p> Open			     75.3500		 75.4200</p>
<p> Close			    75.4700		 75.4500</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  2.135		   0.790</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
